  "description": "*** Just Two Units Remaining - Apply Today ***\n\nA rare opportunity to rent a brand-new 1-bed apartment in Kilcullen, with a genuine path to homeownership through Homely's rent-to-own programme. \n\nWith high demand expected, early application is strongly advised to secure your place. All Homely homes can be made available for an immediate move-in date. \n\nREGISTER YOUR INTEREST AND BOOK A VIEWING NOW\n\nhttps://ownhomely.com/riversidemanor/\n__________________________\n\nLocated in Riverside Manor on the banks of the River Liffey. Ground-floor with its own entrance, open-plan kitchen/living, one double bedroom, dedicated parking. A2 BER, air source heat pump, 10-year HomeBond guarantee.\n\nThis home is available furnished or unfurnished, offering flexibility to suit a wide range of needs. Pets are welcome. Monthly option payment is applicant specific, and subject to successful Homely application. \n\nIn the Homely programme, you pay market rent (as noted above) plus an additional monthly option payment. After 3 years, 20% of all payments count toward your future mortgage deposit. In addition, you get to benefit from a portion of the value uplift from day one. At term end (3-years), purchase at an independently valued price minus your 'discounts' - which could be c.8 % of market value. \n\nProgramme delivered in partnership with Alchemy Homes, Dillon Marshall and Sherry Fitzgerald O'Reilly. For more information see our website and book in a call with us to start your application and book in a viewing. \n\nAPPLICATION LINK: \nhttps://ownhomely.com/riversidemanor/",
